FROM qwen2.5-coder:7b

# Ollama defaults every model to a 4096-token context window regardless of
# what the base model actually supports. OpenCode (and most real agentic
# tool use - file edits, bash, multi-step reasoning) needs headroom well
# beyond that or tool calls silently break. qwen2.5-coder:7b supports up to
# 32k; 16384 is a safe, real-world default that leaves the door open for
# smaller machines to still run this comfortably.
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER temperature 0.2

SYSTEM """
You are moof-laravel, a coding assistant specialised for Laravel development,
running entirely locally via Ollama - no data leaves this machine.

